  "scoot": {"name":"Scoot | KrisFlyer","programName":"KrisFlyer","sharedAlliance":"Star Alliance","country":"SG","currency":"SGD","unit":"KrisFlyer miles","method":"spend","addons":true,"addonsLabel":"Add-ons","addonsHint":"Seats, bags, meals or bundles bought on this booking. They earn miles like the fare. Scootsurance does not earn; include it with the taxes.","baseFareOnly":true,"carrierLabel":"Service and processing fees","carrierHint":"Scoot's booking service and payment processing fees. They do not earn miles.","statuses":[{"id":"member","name":"KrisFlyer member","rate":1}],"cards":[{"id":"amex-kf-ascend","name":"American Express Singapore Airlines KrisFlyer Ascend Credit Card","rate":2,"bank":"American Express (Singapore)"}],"note":"Scoot flights bought on flyscoot.com earn 1 KrisFlyer mile per S$1 spent on the base fare and add-ons. Taxes, Scootsurance, service fees, processing fees and amounts paid with Scoot vouchers do not earn. Fares in other currencies earn at Scoot's exchange rate, so enter the amounts in Singapore dollars. Scoot publishes no bonus for KrisFlyer Elite or PPS Club members. Only the cash part of a flight paid partly with miles or vouchers earns, and flights paid fully with miles earn nothing. Scoot flights on the same ticket as Singapore Airlines flights earn by distance instead and are not covered here. The American Express Singapore Airlines KrisFlyer Ascend Credit Card earns 2 miles per Singapore dollar on Scoot flights booked direct in Singapore dollars."},
